# X-COM writes its labels with an arrow, "CRAFT> Tomahawk-1"; a colon reads as print (John 14 Nov 19:14,
# the text treatment). Every stock en-US string with an arrow that the mod does not already set itself.
# Generated once from standard/xcom1/Language/en-US.yml.
